<title>INDIA: Delhi shares rise as cement and steel strengthen.</title>
<headline>Delhi shares rise as cement and steel strengthen.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delhi share prices quoted higher in early trade on Thursday, buoyed by foreign buying in cement and steel stocks, brokers said.</p>
<p>The Delhi Stock Exchange's sensitive index was 8.20 points, or 0.9 percent, higher at 918.55 points after 30 minutes of trade.</p>
</text>
